Template: vds/override_bluetoothd
Type: note
Description: vDS Bluetooth HID Control Limitation
 vDS needs bluetoothd to run with the input plugin disabled to take the direct
 ownership of the Bluetooth HID Control and Interrupt L2CAP channels in order to
 bridge the controller as a virtual USB controller.
 .
 Disabling the input plugin means giving up Bluetooth input devices like mice or
 keyboards. Use the following command to override `bluetoothd.service` to
 disable the input plugin:
 .
 $ sudo /usr/share/vds/override-bluetoothd.sh disable-input --restart
 .
 Use the following command to restore the original `bluetoothd.service`:
 .
 $ sudo /usr/share/vds/override-bluetoothd.sh enable-input --restart
Description-zh_CN.UTF-8: vDS 蓝牙输入设备限制
 vDS 需要关闭 bluetoothd 的输入设备插件以接管蓝牙人体学接口设备和 L2CAP
 中断信道，使得游戏控制器被桥接为虚拟 USB 游戏控制器。
 .
 关闭输入设备插件将会导致蓝牙输入设备（如蓝牙鼠标、蓝牙键盘等）不可用。使用如下命令覆盖
 `bluetoothd.service` 服务以关闭输入设备插件：
 .
 $ sudo /usr/share/vds/override-bluetoothd.sh disable-input --restart
 .
 使用如下命令恢复原有 `bluetoothd.service` 服务：
 .
 $ sudo /usr/share/vds/override-bluetoothd.sh enable-input --restart
